  DisplayName: Speculators Ruined on the Bourse
  EventType: 1
  Description: A mining share that every Paris speculator held {has collapsed|is
    about to collapse} overnight. The ruined {are selling|will sell} their wives'
    jewels and their salon furniture, and the buyers who remain {are|will be} in
    no mood to bid.
